                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Simple cheap and fun [/h1]\nThe game looks like a typical arcade game from phones, but it doesn't hurt anything because it is very pleasant, cute and playable.\nWe get a ball and our task is to get to the end of the open world,to do this we have to collect stars that allow us to open more portals, which forces us to explore the entire map, it is linear and non-linear at the same time.\nWe can stretch our ball and shoot in the desired direction, depending on the color of the plane, the ball will stick or bounce, the number of platforms is not particularly varied, but the number of mini-levels is large enough not to get bored with them.\n\nThe only drawback of the game is that it is too simple, as I wrote earlier, a typical phone game, easy, fun and cheap.",
